 lr=0.03), shallow (max_depth=4, n_estimators=1200, lr=0.05, reg_lambda=2, reg_alpha=1), and character n-gram specialized (default params trained on only character n-grams). (2) One LightGBM classifier (num_leaves=40, lr=0.03, n_estimators=1000, feature_fraction=0.7, bagging_fraction=0.7, bagging_freq=5). Also keep Logistic Regression on TF-IDF sparse features as a baseline. The ensemble will be weighted using grid search on validation log loss.", "training_evaluation": "Modify training to handle new models: implement training loops for XGBoost (early stopping), LightGBM (early stopping), and Logistic Regression. Use grid search over ensemble weights (0.05 step) to optimize validation log loss. Remove GPU-related code and early stopping for transformer. Keep existing evaluate functions but adapt for tree models. Ensure submission file is written to './submission/submission.csv' with correct columns. Preserve data splits, seed, and evaluation metric."}, "parse_success": true, "raw_response": "{
